WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.410
Software Bills of Materials provide structured visibility into software components,

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:06.027
dependencies, and supply chains.

00:00:06.027 --> 00:00:10.010
SBOMs support vulnerability management, supply chain security, procurement,

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.000
compliance activities, and risk management decisions.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.510
They are most useful when generated consistently, tied to software releases, kept current,

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:17.975
and integrated with operational workflows.

00:00:17.975 --> 00:00:22.010
SBOMs do not replace secure development or vulnerability management.

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:24.000
They make those programs better informed.
